layout_mode = 2
title = "MISSION I"
mission_text = "This is your first mission, USER.

------------  Searching Open-Ended End-to-End Crypto Encryption System Servicing Software (OEEECESSS)
------------ MESSAGE ID:    '1827307231674'
------------ = MESSAGE FROM:    COOL PERSON

Welcome to Faltas, we've sent you here to help aid in the effort to destroy our planets common enemy. As you are one of many, we don't care if you die, but if you don't, we expect that they will use stronger and stronger force until you do. Complete the first level, so we can narrow down our candidates for the second mission. Good luck.

----------- MESSAGE ENDED

Mission Objective: Reach level 2"
level_till_next_unlock = 5
unlocked_from_start = true

